<template><ElConfigProvider namespace="kel"><section class="native-backfill"><header><div><h3>历史补跑</h3><small>{{scheduleRevision?'已保存的项目调度 · Revision '+scheduleRevision:'先保存项目范围调度，再选择历史时间窗'}}</small></div><KsButton size="small" @click="emit('refresh')">刷新记录</KsButton></header><div class="window"><label>开始时间<input type="datetime-local" :value="start" @change="emit('window','start',value($event))"/></label><label>结束时间<input type="datetime-local" :value="end" @change="emit('window','end',value($event))"/></label><KsButton :disabled="!canExecute||!scheduleRevision||!start||!end||busy" @click="emit('preview')">预览历史时刻</KsButton></div><p v-if="error" class="error">{{error}}</p><div v-if="preview" class="preview"><b>{{preview.count}}{{preview.truncated?'+':''}} 个历史时刻</b><span>{{preview.cron}} · {{preview.timezone}} · {{preview.run.target_ids.length}} 台设备</span><p v-if="preview.truncated" class="warning">历史时刻超过单批200条，请缩小时间范围；不会截断后悄悄提交。</p><p v-if="preview.requires_approval" class="warning">该任务需要逐次审批。批次创建后，每个历史时刻须单独申请并绑定批准记录；不会复用原调度审批。</p><details><summary>确认本次时刻与冻结范围</summary><div class="dates"><time v-for="date in preview.occurrences" :key="date">{{new Date(date).toLocaleString()}}</time></div><pre>{{preview.run.target_ids.join('\n')}}</pre></details><KsButton type="primary" :disabled="!canExecute||busy||preview.truncated||!preview.count" @click="emit('create')">创建历史补跑批次</KsButton></div><article v-for="job in jobs" :key="job.id" class="job"><div class="job-head"><b>{{job.state}}</b><code>{{job.id.slice(0,12)}}</code><span>{{job.items.filter(i=>i.state==='SUCCEEDED').length}} / {{job.items.length}} 已创建执行</span><KsButton v-if="['PENDING','RUNNING'].includes(job.state)" size="small" :disabled="!canExecute||busy" @click="emit('action',job,'pause')">暂停后续项</KsButton><KsButton v-if="job.state==='PAUSED'" size="small" :disabled="!canExecute||busy" @click="emit('action',job,'resume')">继续</KsButton><KsButton v-if="job.items.some(i=>i.state==='UNKNOWN')" size="small" :disabled="!canExecute||busy" @click="emit('action',job,'reconcile')">对账</KsButton><KsButton v-if="!['COMPLETED','CANCELLED'].includes(job.state)" size="small" :disabled="!canExecute||busy" @click="emit('action',job,'cancel')">取消未派发项</KsButton></div><div v-for="item in job.items" :key="item.ordinal" class="item"><time>{{item.scheduled_at?new Date(item.scheduled_at).toLocaleString():'—'}}</time><b>{{item.state}}</b><button v-if="item.execution_id" class="link" @click="emit('navigate','/flows/executions/'+item.execution_id)">{{item.execution_id.slice(0,12)}} →</button><span>{{item.error_code||item.result.state||'—'}}</span><KsButton v-if="item.state==='BLOCKED'&&canExecute" size="small" @click="emit('approval',job,item.ordinal)">查看冻结请求 / 审批</KsButton></div></article><p v-if="!jobs.length" class="empty">尚无历史补跑批次。未来时刻不属于此功能，不会启动第二套Cron调度器。</p></section></ElConfigProvider></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import {ElConfigProvider} from 'element-plus';import KsButton from '../../vendor/kestra/design-system/components/Basic/KsButton/KsButton.vue';defineProps<{scheduleRevision:number;canExecute:boolean;start:string;end:string;busy:boolean;error:string;preview:any;jobs:any[]}>();const emit=defineEmits(['refresh','window','preview','create','action','navigate','approval']);const value=(e:Event)=>(e.target as HTMLInputElement).value;
</script>
<style scoped>.native-backfill{margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--ks-border-default);padding:20px;color:var(--ks-text-primary);font:12px var(--ks-font-family-sans)}header,.window,.job-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}header>div{margin-right:auto}h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px}small{font-size:10px;color:var(--ks-text-secondary)}.window{padding:18px 0;align-items:flex-end}.window label{font-size:11px;color:var(--ks-text-secondary)}input{display:block;margin-top:6px;padding:7px;background:var(--ks-bg-input);color:var(--ks-text-primary);border:1px solid var(--ks-border-default);border-radius:4px}.preview{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--ks-border-default);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:20px}.preview>b{margin-right:14px}.preview>span,.warning,.empty{color:var(--ks-text-secondary);font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}.warning{color:#bd9865}.preview details{margin:14px 0}.dates{max-height:150px;overflow:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;padding-top:12px;font-size:10px}.job{border-top:1px solid var(--ks-border-default);padding:16px 0}.job-head{font-size:11px;margin-bottom:12px}.item{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--ks-border-default);font-size:10px}.item>span{margin-right:auto}.link{color:var(--ks-text-link)}.error{color:#df7490}.empty{padding:18px 0}pre{font-size:10px;max-height:150px;overflow:auto}</style>
